      "sections": [
        {
          "number": "4.1",
          "title": "Method",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "Each topic follows one cycle: a short input, then an exercise, then a discussion. The trainer facilitates rather than lectures, keeps time and collects feedback."
              ]
            },
            {
